2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     FUT-VWAP cross-count >= CHOP_VWAP_CROSSES_MIN (3) OR first-hour range <
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     CHOP_RANGE_PT_MAX (110pt)). Exits always allowed. Fails OPEN (not enough
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     bars yet -> no decision -> trade normally). morning_chop_verdict().
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]   + #2 VWAP BODY BAND (VWAP_BODY_CLIMAX_PCT): VWAP entry now takes only the
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     65-86% body band — existing >=65% min kept, NEW >=87% climax/exhaustion bars
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     skipped (climax bars fade). One added guard line in check_vwap_signal().
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]   + #3 MOMENTUM-FADE GATE (FADE_GATE_ENABLED): for a 3rd+ consecutive same-side
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     entry that follows >= FADE_MIN_PRIOR_WINS (2) consecutive same-side WINS,
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     inspect 3-min option premiums of BOTH the trend-side and opposite-side ATM
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     strikes over the last FADE_OPT_BARS (3) closed bars. Enter ONLY IF the
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     trend-side option is NOT decaying AND the opposite-side option IS decaying;
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     otherwise skip (momentum has faded / is rotating to the other side). Fails
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     OPEN on missing data. fade_gate_ok() + fetch_option_3m(). Complements the
2026-07-07 03:30:20,574 [INFO]     V2.5.16 spot-move momentum gate (both must pass).
